OpenSSL with the legacy provider: the openssl module of php56-openssl
built with --with-openssl-legacy-provider (of azsupport/php-src), so
that the ciphers and digests of the legacy provider of OpenSSL work
too: RC4, Blowfish, DES, CAST5, MD4. The same files as php56-openssl:
install one of the two.

The module openssl of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/openssl.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/openssl.
